      "ts": "2026-02-15T16:51:54.473479224-08:00",
      "seq": 868,
      "message": "Ahhhh, the final pieces of my MASTER PLAN fall into place! *cackles maniacally* You see, my dear opponent, while you thought this was merely a game of creatures and combat... you have failed to account for the DARK MACHINATIONS I have been weaving!",
