      "seq": 873,
      "message": "*dramatic flourish* And NOW, my magnificent Serra Avatar - empowered by my UNSTOPPABLE SORCERY - shall deliver the FINAL BLOW! When this 71/71 angel of destruction strikes, its lifelink shall trigger my DRAIN EFFECT, and you shall lose SEVENTY-ONE LIFE! MWAHAHAHAHAHA!",
